skull rider~
a skull rider~
A skull with eight thin legs skitters around here.
~
It's your average human skull, with eight legs protruding from its base. Skull
riders are strong spiders that carry skulls on their backs to scare away
predators. Raithir accidentally let some of the skull riders mate, and now
