moonbeast~
a moonbeast~
A horrifying moonbeast jiggles in anticipation of its next meal.
~
The moonbeast has a large octopoid body with at least ten tentacles. Within
the circle of tentacles lies its tooth-filled maw. Its bulbous body is covered
with dozens of eye stalks, each about a foot long. Its skin is a mottled grey,
and is covered with a slimy secretion. This moonbeast burst into the Grey Keep
one day, long ago, causing immense damage to the walls and ceilings. It went
directly toward Nimos' chamber, but was incapacitated by the combined efforts
of several of the generals of the Keep. They managed to imprison it here, in
the second dungeon.
~
