#14434
flaming skull~
a flaming skull~
A flaming skull levitates here and begins floating towards you.
~
It's a normal humanoid skull, engulfed in flames. Through the flames, you see
in the black eye sockets red, glowing pinpoints. The flaming skull has been
here a long time, and Gil-Glash, although he has imprisoned it, usually comes
down and has long conversations with it when his generals are away. The skull
was once a very knowledgable sage, who predicted the downfall of one of
Gil-Glash's greatest enemies. Gil-Glash, knowing opportunity's unique knock,
called the sage to the Grey Keep, and made him one of him advisor-generals.
When the sage, eventually, died of old age, Gil-Glash made an elaborate
ceremony in which he burned several of his slaves on the sage's funeral pyre.
This act brought the flaming skull to life.
~
