#14435
yuk-shaar~
a yuk-shaar~
A yuk-shaar floats lazily towards you.
~
It appears to be a set of floating eyeballs, and a pair of floating, skeletal
hands. The hands and eyes glow with a greenish hue. Nimos was able to catch
the yuk-shaar one day when Gil-Glash wasn't in the keep. One of Raithir's
enemies sent the yuk-shaar out to him, and it would have succeeded, had it not
tripped one of Nimos' magical alarms. Nimos came to Raithir's rescue, and a
great battle ensued. Nimos was barely able to contain the yuk-shaar by the end
of the fight, but he managed, and locked it up in the second dungeon, never to
bother anyone again.
~
