#14436
nightmare beast~
the nightmare beast~
The huge nightmare beast charges towards you.
~
Towering at nearly twenty feet high, and weighing a couple of tons, this
nightmare has four legs, each ending in a set of sharp claws. Its dark purple
skin looks extremely thick and tough. Its large, red eyes glow with an evil
light. The beast's teeth are very long; more than half a foot in length, and
look sharp enough to cut easily through solid stone. Two pair of its teeth are
nearly twice as long as the rest; one set in the upper jaw, the other in the
lower. Two large, tusk-like horns protrude from its head.
The nightmare beast was set against the Grey Keep by one of Gil-Glash's more
powerful enemies, but Lady Amber took it upon herself to defend the Keep
against the horrid creature. They fought for many hours, neither seeming to
tire. In the end, Lady Amber prevailed, and she incapacitated the beast. Nimos
then teleported its stunned form into the second dungeon.
~
