#14437
rampager~
the rampager~
The rampager stomps towards you at an amazing speed.
~
The body of the huge, six-legged rampager is covered in grey scales. Its four
rear legs are large round pads, while claws as long as daggers extend from its
two front legs. Its face is out of a nightmare; long, dirty fangs, and glowing
red eyes. Its nose is similar to a vestigal horn, and it has small, rounded
ears. A druidic magickal spell gone awry created the rampager, and the minute
that Gil-Glash heard of its destructive capabilities, he set Hisczdrezzez on
its path. The yuan-ti was overjoyed at finally having something to do, other
than roam the keep, and he took this job very seriously. It took over a year
of tracking, and several failed attempts at capture, but Hisczdrezzez finally
brought the rampager back to his leige.
~
