gulguthydra~
a gulguthydra~
A disgusting, garbage-covered gulguthydra crawls around here.
~
The mix between an otyugh and a hydra, this truly is a disgusting creature.
Six misshapen hydra heads perch in a circle atop the hulking body of the
hybrid, which also possesses an otyughs two rigid tentacles. Its skin looks
hard, almost rocklike, and its dusky brown coloration aids it in hiding within
its chosen domain. Nobody knows what brought it there, but the gulguthydra was
found in the sewers beneath the Grey Keep, it took a large group of Grey
Slayers to bring it back up, and when Gil-Glash saw it, he didn't want it to
be destroyed so he ordered that they herd it into a cell in the second
dungeon.
~
